{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:     Hello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:     Oh, hi Victoria. It's Sally. I hope I'm not disturbing you. I've been trying to reach you all day.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:     Sally! Yes, I've been running around all day. Our next issue is coming out soon. We have lots of loose ends to tie up here. How are you?<br/>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:     I've been better. I've thrown out my back.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:     Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:     Yes, it's quite bad. I may have a slipped disk. I fell down at the bowling alley and haven't been able to walk since. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:     That's sounds awful. <br/>", "time": "24000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:     I know I have a target date coming up for my article. I'm not sure if I can get it done by end of business day Friday. Would it be okay if I provided you the article next week, not this week?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:      Hm, yes, I understand. However, we have deliverables for the publishing house. I'm not sure if we can accommodate a layout change at this point. We've been negotiating with a new publishing house for a different contract. It's still up in the air.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:     Okay, I'm wondering if I could have it in by Sunday end-of-day? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Victoria</span>:     I'll have to think about it and get back to you.", "time": "39300", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about recent actions and routines. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can ask someone a favor. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  How often do you talk to your boss or teacher directly? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What have you been doing at work or school recently? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you asked any favors from anyone?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " I've been trying to reach you all day.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Sally calls her boss at the magazine. Ms. Ryan has lots of <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">loose ends to tie up</span>.", "type": "text"}]},